MARK MANDEL: That sounds great.

00:33:19.570 --> 00:33:19.890
MELANIE WARRICK: I know.

00:33:19.890 --> 00:33:20.100
JEFF DEAN: Yes.

00:33:20.100 --> 00:33:20.490
MELANIE WARRICK: He's great.

