00:38:22.730 --> 00:38:24.438
JEFF DEAN: That is a
lot of schools, yes.

00:38:24.438 --> 00:38:26.800
The, like, oh, new
year, new school.

00:38:26.800 --> 00:38:27.870
MELANIE WARRICK: You learned
how to make a lot of friends,

00:38:27.870 --> 00:38:28.360
