00:38:47.470 --> 00:38:49.303
JEFF DEAN: I think it
does help, because you

00:38:49.303 --> 00:38:52.694
can find really great aspects
of any of those places.

00:38:52.694 --> 00:38:54.610
And I think that's a
good perspective to have.

00:38:54.610 --> 00:38:55.330
MARK MANDEL: Fantastic.

00:38:55.330 --> 00:38:56.890
Before we wrap up,
any resources you

00:38:56.890 --> 00:38:59.080
want to recommend to
our listeners for people

00:38:59.080 --> 00:39:01.750
want to get into deep learning,
TPUs, Google Brain, just ML

00:39:01.750 --> 00:39:02.770
research?

00:39:02.770 --> 00:39:04.895
JEFF DEAN: You know, I'm
